      "manifest": "assets/audio/v2/en/narration.json",
      "source_audio": "assets/audio/v2/en/beats/programming.mp3",
      "text": "At the visit, a hearing specialist called an audiologist programs the speech processor you wear outside your ear. The program is made for your needs."
    },
